<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alternative Living started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alternative Living started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp analyst Gregory Moerschel said he started coverage of Alternative Living Services Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the developer of assisted living communities for the elderly were up 1/4 to 14-5/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;ALI is distinguished by its operating strategy, experienced management team, well-developed infrastructure and ready access to significant capital resources,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
